            "item_title_weight": "700",
            "item_body_color": "",
            "item_body_size_desktop": 14,
            "item_body_size_mobile": 13,
            "item_1_title": "Description",
            "item_1_body": "<p>Experience full-body contrast therapy from the comfort of your home. The Sauna Pod is the world’s first patent-pending portable dry hot-air sauna, engineered to reach up to 85°C (185°F) in minutes without toxic off-gassing. Paired with your included Free Ice Pod, this setup unlocks professional-grade contrast therapy to accelerate athletic recovery, reduce chronic inflammation, flush toxins, and improve restorative sleep. Built with double-layer non-toxic cotton canvas and food-grade TPU windows for safe, comfortable daily sessions across Canadian seasons.</p><p></p><h3></h3>",
            "item_2_title": "Key Features",
            "item_2_body": "<p>• <strong>Extreme Heat Performance:</strong> High-output 1500W dry-heat heater heats up to 85°C (185°F) in under 20 minutes.</p><p>• <strong>100% Non-Toxic Design:</strong> Made with natural unbleached cotton canvas and food-grade components—no toxic chemical smells or plastic vapor.</p><p>• <strong>Complete Contrast Therapy:</strong> Free Ice Pod included for rapid cold water immersion after every sauna session.</p><p>• <strong>Red-Light Ambience:</strong> Built-in ambient light setting promotes deeper relaxation and recovery while you sweat.</p><p>• <strong>Spacious & Comfortable:</strong> Extra-tall interior with an included stainless-steel folding chair, designed to comfortably fit users up to 200 cm (6'7\") and 150 kg (330 lbs).</p>",
            "item_3_title": "Shipping & Returns",
            "item_3_body": "<p>• <strong>Canada-Wide Fast Delivery:</strong> Fast courier dispatch with all provincial taxes handled at checkout—<strong>100% guaranteed no unexpected customs or duty fees</strong>.</p><p>• <strong>Dispatch Time:</strong> Ships directly from regional fulfillment facilities within 24–48 hours.</p><p>• <strong>30-Day Risk-Free Home Trial:</strong> Try the full Sauna Pod + Ice Pod combo at home for 30 days. If you are not completely satisfied, return it for a refund.</p><p>• <strong>Warranty Protection:</strong> Backed by an all-inclusive 2-Year Canadian Manufacturer Warranty.</p>",
            "item_4_title": "What's in the Box?",
            "item_4_body": "<p>• 1x The Sauna Pod (Natural Canvas Shell & Lightweight Frame)</p><p>• 1x 1500W High-Performance Dry Air Heater with Remote & Hose</p><p>• 1x Ergonomic Heavy-Duty Stainless Steel Folding Chair</p><p>• 1x BONUS The Standard Ice Pod Cold Plunge ($199 CAD Value — FREE)</p><p>• 1x BONUS All-Weather Insulated Plunge Cover</p><p>• 1x Floating Water Thermometer & User Manual</p>",
            "item_5_title": "Technical Specs",
            "item_5_body": "<p>• <strong>Max Temperature:</strong> Up to 85°C / 185°F</p><p>• <strong>Heat-Up Time:</strong> 15–20 minutes</p><p>• <strong>Heater Power:</strong> 1500W (Standard 110V/120V Canadian Wall Outlet Compatible)</p><p>• <strong>Materials:</strong> Double-layer unbleached natural cotton canvas, food-grade TPU, powder-coated steel frame</p><p>• <strong>User Fit:</strong> Fits heights up to 200 cm (6'7\") and weights up to 150 kg (330 lbs)</p><p>• <strong>Certifications:</strong> North American Electrical & Fire Safety Certified (ETL/UL compliant components)</p>",
            "item_6_title": "",
            "item_6_body": ""
          }
        },
